1
00:00:02,001 --> 00:00:03,196
Before season five,

2
00:00:03,216 --> 00:00:05,021
let's go back in time.

3
00:00:05,041 --> 00:00:07,021
Fred Johnson and Amos Burton

4
00:00:07,041 --> 00:00:09,291
have been with us since season one.

5
00:00:09,401 --> 00:00:11,556
One became a leader of the Belt.

6
00:00:11,576 --> 00:00:14,681
The other became the Rocinante's mechanic.

7
00:00:14,701 --> 00:00:16,156
Two short stories,

8
00:00:16,176 --> 00:00:17,906
The Butcher of Anderson Station

9
00:00:17,926 --> 00:00:19,031
and The Churn,

10
00:00:19,051 --> 00:00:19,656
show who they

11
00:00:19,676 --> 00:00:21,206
were before we met them.

12
00:00:21,226 --> 00:00:22,535
Spoilers ahead!

13
00:00:23,299 --> 00:00:25,729
Story one: Fred Johnson.

14
00:00:25,749 --> 00:00:27,104
Years before season one,

15
00:00:27,124 --> 00:00:27,929
he is a colonel

16
00:00:27,949 --> 00:00:30,399
in the United Nations Marines.

17
00:00:30,504 --> 00:00:31,628
On Anderson Station,

18
00:00:31,648 --> 00:00:33,899
a small station in the Belt,

19
00:00:33,919 --> 00:00:34,849
Belters fed up

20
00:00:34,869 --> 00:00:37,424
with crushing taxes take control.

21
00:00:37,444 --> 00:00:39,574
Fred is ordered to take it back.

22
00:00:39,594 --> 00:00:41,574
His marines storm in.

23
00:00:41,594 --> 00:00:43,574
More than a thousand people die,

24
00:00:43,594 --> 00:00:45,175
most of them civilians.

25
00:00:45,885 --> 00:00:47,935
Earth calls Fred a hero.

26
00:00:47,955 --> 00:00:49,410
The Belt calls him the Butcher

27
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:51,110
of Anderson Station.

28
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:52,860
Then he learns the truth.

29
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,710
The station had tried to surrender,

30
00:00:54,730 --> 00:00:57,005
and his own superiors hid it.

31
00:00:57,035 --> 00:00:59,415
The killing never needed to happen.

32
00:00:59,435 --> 00:01:01,640
Fred walks away from Earth and joins

33
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,540
the Outer Planets Alliance,

34
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,315
the people he once fought.

35
00:01:05,335 --> 00:01:05,865
That is how

36
00:01:05,885 --> 00:01:08,566
the Butcher ends up running Tycho Station.

37
00:01:09,304 --> 00:01:11,734
Story two: Amos Burton.

38
00:01:11,754 --> 00:01:13,734
Back then, he goes by Timmy.

39
00:01:13,754 --> 00:01:14,934
He grew up in the slums

40
00:01:14,954 --> 00:01:16,564
of Baltimore, a child

41
00:01:16,584 --> 00:01:18,734
no system ever registered.

42
00:01:18,759 --> 00:01:19,839
He works as muscle

43
00:01:19,859 --> 00:01:22,339
for a crime boss named Burton.

44
00:01:22,359 --> 00:01:23,444
His best friend,

45
00:01:23,464 --> 00:01:26,404
Erich, forges fake IDs for the gang.

46
00:01:26,424 --> 00:01:28,154
Lydia, a woman who looks out

47
00:01:28,174 --> 00:01:29,904
for him, is the closest thing he

48
00:01:29,924 --> 00:01:30,992
has to a mother.

49
00:01:31,693 --> 00:01:33,123
Then comes the churn,

50
00:01:33,143 --> 00:01:36,043
a police crackdown on Baltimore's gangs.

51
00:01:36,178 --> 00:01:37,823
Afraid of who might talk,

52
00:01:37,843 --> 00:01:40,248
Burton orders Timmy to kill Erich.

53
00:01:40,268 --> 00:01:42,673
Timmy kills Burton instead.

54
00:01:42,693 --> 00:01:45,323
Erich repays him with Burton's own identity

55
00:01:45,343 --> 00:01:47,098
and a ticket off Earth.

56
00:01:47,118 --> 00:01:49,973
That's how Timmy becomes Amos Burton.

57
00:01:49,993 --> 00:01:51,323
Years later, he signs

58
00:01:51,343 --> 00:01:52,881
on with the Canterbury.

59
00:01:53,635 --> 00:01:56,690
Fred and Amos carry these stories with them.

60
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:58,940
Fred has spent every year since Anderson

61
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:01,110
trying to make peace for the Belt.

62
00:02:01,190 --> 00:02:03,870
Amos left Baltimore and Lydia behind,

63
00:02:03,890 --> 00:02:05,695
and he has never gone back.

64
00:02:05,715 --> 00:02:07,180
That is about to change,

65
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,630
when each of the crew goes off

66
00:02:08,650 --> 00:02:10,780
to face something from the past.

67
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:13,056
Next up: season five.

